msgid ""
"Using Kogito DMN support to add decision automation capabilities to an "
"application"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This guide demonstrates how your Quarkus application can use Kogito to add "
"business automation\n"
"and power it up with DMN decision support."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Kogito is a next generation business automation toolkit that originates from "
"well known Open Source projects\n"
"Drools (for business rules) and jBPM (for business processes). Kogito aims "
"at providing a newer approach\n"
"to business automation where the main message is to expose your business "
"knowledge (processes, rules, decisions, predictions)\n"
"in a domain specific way."
msgstr ""

