msgid "Architecture"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In this example, we build a very simple microservice which offers one REST "
"endpoint:"
msgstr ""

msgid "`/pricing`"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This endpoint will be automatically generated based on the defined DMN model."
""
